# Script writing

Applies to any script (shell, Python, Node, ts-node) the agent writes or edits.

- Safe guard: validate inputs and preconditions before mutating anything
- Default to dry-run; apply changes only with an explicit `--force` flag
- One separate flag (e.g. `--prod`) gates production-only changes
- Expose individual actions behind their own flags so partial runs are possible
- Default behavior merges / updates existing state — never overwrite unless an explicit `--overwrite` flag is passed
